# システム環境設定's 〈機器〉〈機器情報〉「プロセッサ」 on QEMU virt (docs/tessronos/04-kernel.md 4.5.1,
# 08-object.md 8.12), for tools/ui_run.py with the kernel of make TARGET=_QEMU_VIRT_ DESKTOP=1 UITEST=1
# and the test disk of a KTEST=1 build, run with 4 processors: PRC 2 made one for real time, PRC 3 and
# PRC 4 for the chores, and all back. The lists are written as runs ("1,3-4") and each change starts
# from the roles the system took, the page being read again once the system object shows them. The
# window is at 160,80: 「プロセッサ」 is the eighth line of 〈機器情報〉 at 270,303 and 表示 at 706,185;
# on the page PRC 2 to 4 at 300,206, 300,223, 300,240, the roles 普通, 雑務 and 実時間 at 500,222,
# 500,250 and 500,278, and the role's 設定 at 706,354.
open 01a0d8c4-52b6-7b52-9d72-3e8fa01b2c42
expect sysenv: ready
wait 800
click 270 303
wait 300
click 706 185
expect sysenv: processors 4 chores 1 real-time  interrupts 2
wait 800
click 300 206
wait 300
click 500 278
wait 300
click 706 354
wait 1200
expect sysenv: roles CPU_CHORE 1 CPU_RT 2 (0)
expect sysenv: processors 4 chores 1 real-time 2 interrupts 2
click 300 223
wait 300
click 500 250
wait 300
click 706 354
wait 1200
expect sysenv: roles CPU_CHORE 1,3 CPU_RT 2 (0)
click 300 240
wait 300
click 500 250
wait 300
click 706 354
wait 1200
expect sysenv: roles CPU_CHORE 1,3-4 CPU_RT 2 (0)
expect sysenv: processors 4 chores 1,3-4 real-time 2 interrupts 2
wait 500
shot cpu_roles
click 300 206
wait 300
click 500 222
wait 300
click 706 354
wait 1200
click 300 223
wait 300
click 500 222
wait 300
click 706 354
wait 1200
click 300 240
wait 300
click 500 222
wait 300
click 706 354
wait 1200
expect sysenv: roles CPU_CHORE 1 CPU_RT  (0)
wait 500
shot cpu_back
absent !OACV!
